03:15.700 --> 03:18.760
And when they had sung a hymn, they went out to the Mount of Olives.

03:19.120 --> 03:20.540
And Jesus said to them,

03:21.260 --> 03:23.800
You will all fall away, for it is written,

03:24.340 --> 03:26.720
I will strike the shepherd, and the sheep will be scattered.

03:27.460 --> 03:31.280
But after I am raised up, I will go before you to Galilee.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.160
Peter said to him,

03:33.880 --> 03:36.700
Even though they all fall away, I will not.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.960
And Jesus said to him,

03:38.960 --> 03:44.420
Truly, I tell you, this very night before the rooster crows twice,

03:45.100 --> 03:47.320
you will deny me three times.

03:47.860 --> 03:49.540
But he said emphatically,

03:50.380 --> 03:54.580
If I must die with you, I will not deny you.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.760
And they all said the same.

03:57.460 --> 03:59.960
And they went to a place called Gethsemane,

04:00.240 --> 04:01.720
and he said to his disciples,

04:02.460 --> 04:03.780
Sit here, will I pray?

04:04.160 --> 04:07.020
And he took with him Peter and James and John,

04:07.580 --> 04:08.780
and began to be greatly disappointed.

04:08.960 --> 04:11.440
And he said to them,

04:11.760 --> 04:15.720
My soul is very sorrowful, even to death.

04:16.380 --> 04:17.800
Remain here and watch.

04:18.580 --> 04:19.860
And going a little farther,

04:20.220 --> 04:22.160
he fell on the ground and prayed that,

04:22.500 --> 04:25.020
if it were possible, the hour might pass from him.

04:25.480 --> 04:26.080
And he said,

04:26.780 --> 04:31.000
Abba, Father, all things are possible for you.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.300
Remove this cup from me,

04:34.260 --> 04:37.140
yet not what I will, but what you will.

04:37.620 --> 04:38.940
And he came and found Peter,

04:38.940 --> 04:39.700
and found them sleeping.

04:40.240 --> 04:41.220
And he said to Peter,

04:41.960 --> 04:43.960
Simon, are you asleep?

04:44.580 --> 04:46.380
Could you not watch one hour?

04:47.400 --> 04:50.100
Watch and pray that you may not enter into temptation.

04:50.840 --> 04:54.300
The spirit indeed is willing, but the flesh is weak.

04:55.260 --> 04:58.440
And again he went away and prayed, saying the same words.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.780
And again he came and found them sleeping,

05:01.100 --> 05:02.620
for their eyes were very heavy,

05:02.840 --> 05:04.860
and they did not know what to answer him.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.940
And he came the third time and said to them,

05:08.280 --> 05:08.920
Are you asleep?

05:08.920 --> 05:10.920
Are you still sleeping and taking your rest?

05:11.580 --> 05:13.140
It is enough, the hour has come.

05:13.700 --> 05:16.380
The Son of Man is betrayed into the hands of sinners.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.920
Rise, let us be going.

05:19.320 --> 05:21.260
See, my betrayer is at hand.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.200
And immediately, while he was still speaking,

05:24.520 --> 05:25.960
Judas came, one of the twelve,

05:26.320 --> 05:28.820
and with him a crowd with swords and clubs

05:28.820 --> 05:31.380
from the chief priests and the scribes and the elders.

05:31.980 --> 05:34.600
Now the betrayer had given them a sign, saying,

05:34.980 --> 05:36.680
The one I will kiss is the man.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.520
Seize him and lead him away under guard.

05:39.080 --> 05:42.840
And when he came, he went up to him at once and said,

05:43.420 --> 05:43.980
Rabbi.

05:45.180 --> 05:46.240
And he kissed him.

05:46.700 --> 05:48.800
And they laid hands on him and seized him.

05:49.240 --> 05:51.600
But one of those who stood by drew his sword

05:51.600 --> 05:53.300
and struck the servant of the high priest

05:53.300 --> 05:54.380
and cut off his ear.

05:54.800 --> 05:56.120
And Jesus said to them,

05:56.660 --> 05:58.880
Have you come out as against a robber

05:58.880 --> 06:01.020
with swords and clubs to capture me?

06:01.640 --> 06:04.080
Day after day I was with you in the temple teaching,

06:04.080 --> 06:05.700
and you did not seize me.

06:06.460 --> 06:08.360
But let the scriptures be fulfilled.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.020
And they all left him and fled.

06:11.900 --> 06:13.220
And a young man followed him

06:13.220 --> 06:15.460
with nothing but a linen cloth about his body.

06:15.860 --> 06:16.920
And they seized him,

06:17.220 --> 06:19.640
but he left the linen cloth and ran away naked.

06:20.900 --> 06:23.080
And they led Jesus to the high priest,

06:23.340 --> 06:25.280
and all the chief priests and the elders

06:25.280 --> 06:26.820
and the scribes came together.

06:28.020 --> 06:30.200
And Peter had followed him at a distance

06:30.200 --> 06:32.520
right into the courtyard of the high priest,

06:32.920 --> 06:34.400
and he was sitting with the guards

06:34.400 --> 06:35.960
and warming himself at the fire.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.900
Now the chief priests and the whole council,

06:38.920 --> 06:41.220
were seeking testimony against Jesus

06:41.220 --> 06:42.420
to put him to death,

06:42.420 --> 06:44.220
but they found none.

06:45.520 --> 06:47.620
For many bore false witness against him,

06:47.620 --> 06:49.520
but their testimony did not agree.

06:49.520 --> 06:52.220
And some stood up and bore false witness against him,

06:52.220 --> 06:52.920
saying,

06:53.420 --> 06:54.820
We heard him say,

06:54.820 --> 06:57.820
I will destroy this temple that is made with hands,

06:57.820 --> 07:00.520
and in three days I will build another

07:00.520 --> 07:02.120
not made with hands.

07:02.720 --> 07:05.620
Yet even about this their testimony did not agree.

07:05.920 --> 07:08.900
And the high priest stood up in the midst and asked Jesus,

07:08.920 --> 07:11.420
Have you no answer to make?

07:11.420 --> 07:14.920
What is it that these men testify against you?

07:14.920 --> 07:17.920
But he remained silent and made no answer.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.920
Again the high priest asked him,

07:19.920 --> 07:24.420
Are you the Christ, the Son of the Blessed?

07:24.420 --> 07:25.920
And Jesus said,

07:25.920 --> 07:27.920
I am.

07:27.920 --> 07:31.420
And you will see the Son of Man seated at the right hand of power,

07:31.420 --> 07:33.920
and coming with the clouds of heaven.

07:33.920 --> 07:36.920
And the high priest tore his garments and said,

07:36.920 --> 07:38.420
What further witness is this?

07:38.420 --> 07:40.420
What witnesses do we need?

07:40.420 --> 07:42.420
You have heard his blasphemy.

07:42.420 --> 07:44.420
What is your decision?

07:44.420 --> 07:47.420
And they all condemned him as deserving death.

07:47.420 --> 07:49.920
And some began to spit on him, and to cover his face,

07:49.920 --> 07:52.420
and to strike him, saying to him,

07:52.420 --> 07:55.420
Prophesy!

07:55.420 --> 07:58.420
And the guards received him with blows.

07:58.420 --> 08:00.420
And as Peter was below in the courtyard,

08:00.420 --> 08:03.420
one of the servant girls of the high priest came,

08:03.420 --> 08:05.420
and seeing Peter warming himself,

08:05.420 --> 08:07.420
she looked at him and said,

08:07.420 --> 08:10.420
You also were with the Nazarene Jesus.

08:10.420 --> 08:12.420
But he denied it, saying,

08:12.420 --> 08:15.420
I neither know nor understand what you mean.

08:15.420 --> 08:17.420
And he went out into the gateway,

08:17.420 --> 08:19.420
and the rooster crowed.

08:19.420 --> 08:21.420
And the servant girl saw him,

08:21.420 --> 08:23.920
and began again to say to the bystanders,

08:23.920 --> 08:26.420
This man is one of them.

08:26.420 --> 08:28.420
But again he denied it.

08:28.420 --> 08:32.420
And after a little while the bystanders again said to Peter,

08:32.420 --> 08:34.420
Certainly you are one of them,

08:34.420 --> 08:36.420
for you are a Galilean.

08:36.420 --> 08:39.420
But he began to invoke a curse on himself, and to swear,

08:39.420 --> 08:43.420
I do not know this man of whom you speak.

08:43.420 --> 08:46.420
And immediately the rooster crowed a second time.

08:46.420 --> 08:49.420
And Peter remembered how Jesus had said to him,

08:49.420 --> 08:52.420
Before the rooster crows twice,

08:52.420 --> 08:55.420
you will deny me three times.

08:55.420 --> 08:57.420
And he broke down and wept.

